<p style="margin-bottom: 1.0em; color: #000000; font: 14px/1.5 arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">With a rash of cyber threats around the country, it is a good time to verify that your system is protected.</p>
<p style="margin-bottom: 1.0em; color: #000000; font: 14px/1.5 arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Fortunately, there are several FREE options available for POTWs. The EPA and Maine National Guard (MENG) offer no-cost vulnerability assessments to POTWs.</p>
<ol style="list-style-position: inside; font: 13px/1.5 Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
<li style="color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">Click <a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.epa.gov%2Fwaterresilience%2Fforms%2Fepas-water-sector-cybersecurity-evaluation-program&amp;data=05%7C02%7CJudy.K.Bruenjes%40maine.gov%7Cc271ea989d6a4d61087e08def9609840%7C413fa8ab207d4b629bcdea1a8f2f864e%7C0%7C0%7C639222390474722185%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=1Q2zkbp6cWIVq638FeXGAhljpGqshaNyeu7lfJ8JVzw%3D&amp;reserved=0" style="color: #3034E9;">Here</a> for more information on EPA’s vulnerability assessment program.<u></u>
</li>
<li style="color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">Please contact <a href="mailto:kevin.l.moncrieffe.mil@army.mil" style="color: #3034E9;">kevin.l.moncrieffe.mil@army.mil</a> if you would like to know more about MENG cyber assessments.</li>
</ol>
<p style="margin-bottom: 1.0em; color: #000000; font: 14px/1.5 arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">The Cybersecurity &amp; Infrastructure Security Agency (CISA) offers Vulnerability and Web Application Scanning. Organizations typically reduce their risk and exposure by 40% within the first 12 months of these services. Click <a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cisa.gov%2Fcyber-hygiene-services&amp;data=05%7C02%7CJudy.K.Bruenjes%40maine.gov%7Cc271ea989d6a4d61087e08def9609840%7C413fa8ab207d4b629bcdea1a8f2f864e%7C0%7C0%7C639222390474755389%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=Tatnm%2F%2FX%2F1JkolH%2BwXNkevIM7PlzJAz4qVWPEcklJXs%3D&amp;reserved=0" style="color: #3034E9;">Here</a> for more information on CISA Cyber Hygiene Services.</p>
<p style="margin-bottom: 1.0em; color: #000000; font: 14px/1.5 arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">In addition, Maine Rural Water Association (MRWA) has partnered with DEF CON <em>Franklin</em> to offer FREE cybersecurity technical assistance to small communities. <em>Franklin</em>'s<em> </em>cyber volunteers are highly qualified to help you scope your cyber needs, identify existing vulnerabilities, and patch up any weaknesses. Over the past year, the program has assisted small and rural water systems in Arizona, Idaho, Indiana, Utah, Oregon, and Vermont, and is now expanding its services to the state of Maine. The initiative is named the <em>]]></content><link href="https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/MEDEP/bulletins/425e035"/><category term="Maine Agencies"/><category term="DEP"/><category term="role:environmental-land-use"/><category term="role:tax"/><category term="role:securities-financial"/><published>2026-08-26T13:15:00.887763+00:00</published></entry><entry><id>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/MEDEP/bulletins/426b2e7#d8bfedc50f7788b9</id><title>Maine DEP Initiates Legal Action Against Mallinckrodt US LLC to Address Cleanup Failures at Orrington Site</title><updated>2026-08-29T20:54:33.303463+00:00</updated><content type="CDATA"><![CDATA[<article>
